#: title/pc5_ui.c:6266
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: VKD3D-Proton turns the game's Direct3D 12 into Vulkan. The "
"fastest, and what most games want."
msgstr ""
"PC5's valg: VKD3D-Proton laver spillets Direct3D 12 om til Vulkan. Det "
"hurtigste og det, de fleste spil vil have."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6267
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: Wine's own Direct3D draws the game's DirectDraw with OpenGL."
msgstr ""
"PC5's valg: Wines egen Direct3D tegner spillets DirectDraw med OpenGL."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6268
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: DXVK turns the game's Direct3D into Vulkan. The fastest, and "
"what most games want."
msgstr ""
"PC5's valg: DXVK laver spillets Direct3D om til Vulkan. Det hurtigste og "
"det, de fleste spil vil have."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6270
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D 12 (VKD3D). Slower than Auto; try it if the game won't "
"start or draws wrong."
msgstr ""
"Wines egen Direct3D 12 (VKD3D). Langsommere end Auto; prøv det, hvis "
"spillet ikke vil starte eller tegner forkert."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6272
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D, drawing with Vulkan. Try it if the game draws wrong "
"with Auto; often faster than WineD3D."
msgstr ""
"Wines egen Direct3D, der tegner med Vulkan. Prøv det, hvis spillet tegner "
"forkert med Auto; ofte hurtigere end WineD3D."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6273
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D, drawing with OpenGL. The slowest; try it if the game "
"won't start with the others."
msgstr ""
"Wines egen Direct3D, der tegner med OpenGL. Det langsomste; prøv det, hvis "
"spillet ikke vil starte med de andre."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6294
#, c-format
msgid "The game uses %s"
msgstr "Spillet bruger %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6306
msgid "In use"
msgstr "I brug"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6326
msgid ""
"PC5 runs your PC games with prospero-win: Wine, DXVK for Direct3D 8 to 11, "
"VKD3D-Proton for Direct3D 12, and Mesa (RADV for Vulkan, Zink for OpenGL)."
msgstr ""
"PC5 kører dine pc-spil med prospero-win: Wine, DXVK til Direct3D 8 til 11, "
"VKD3D-Proton til Direct3D 12 og Mesa (RADV til Vulkan, Zink til OpenGL)."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6328
msgid ""
"Covers come from Steam, GOG, PCGamingWiki and Wikidata, and SteamGridDB "
