msgid "Not opened: %s"
msgstr "Ikke åbnet: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:283
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Text files only (.ini, .cfg, .txt, .json, .reg and the like), up to 8 MB. "
"The console's File manager changes them too, a line at a time."
msgstr ""
"Kun tekstfiler (.ini, .cfg, .txt, .json, .reg og lignende) op til 8 MB. "
"Konsollens filhåndtering ændrer dem også, en linje ad gangen."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:294
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No games yet."
msgstr "Ingen spil endnu."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:297
msgctxt "web"
msgid "USB drive"
msgstr "USB-drev"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:298
msgctxt "web"
msgid "can't start"
msgstr "kan ikke starte"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:303
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Settings: %s"
msgstr "Indstillinger: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:306
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Newest log"
msgstr "Nyeste logfil"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:308
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "Rapportér et problem"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:309
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Downloads the newest log and opens GitHub's form, filled in: attach the "
"log there."
msgstr ""
"Downloader den nyeste logfil og åbner GitHubs formular udfyldt: Vedhæft "
"logfilen der."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:315
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Launch options (launch.txt)"
msgstr "Startindstillinger (launch.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:316
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"The first line that isn't empty or a comment (# or ;) is added to the "
"program's command line."
msgstr ""
"Den første linje, der ikke er tom eller en kommentar (# eller ;), føjes "
"til programmets kommandolinje."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Environment variables (env.txt)"
msgstr "Miljøvariabler (env.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid "One NAME=value a line, set before the game starts."
msgstr "Én NAVN=værdi pr. linje, sat før spillet starter."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:321
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"
msgstr "Ekstra logning (winedebug.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:322
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Only when an issue asks for it, for example err+all,+seh. Empty it "
"afterwards: it slows the game down."
msgstr ""
"Kun når et issue beder om det, for eksempel err+all,+seh. Tøm den "
"bagefter: Den gør spillet langsommere."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
